          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Buzz is nervous around bikes; ever since he had a big fall off one of the class kids bikes a few years ago. Nellie and Gibbs are ready to make him an expert cyclist and set about giving Buzz a crash course in bike riding - starting with the very first bike with no pedals or steering, onto the penny farthing and then to explore today’s bikes and the different types you can buy. Whilst Buzz finally masters bike riding, it’s Gibbs and Nellie who struggle as they attempt to ride a tandem together! ",
